model m10
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T's member for 228.Q10 (invented): its on is before the joint model's"

source s "invented"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input pay: money PLN

move wage[m in months]: transfers
  on start_of(m)
  leg cash from world to konto amount pay

version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  pay = 100.00 PLN "s"
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"

ask b: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) as known 2026-05-01
ask c: bal(konto, 2026-06-30) as known 2026-03-01
